THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
======================

This repository vendors code from two external projects, each retaining
its own licence.

Falcon reference implementation
-------------------------------
`fft.c`, `fpr.c`, `fpr.h`, `inner.h` and `config.h` are taken unmodified
from the Falcon reference implementation, Copyright (c) 2017-2019 Falcon
Project, author Thomas Pornin. They are distributed under the MIT licence
reproduced in the header of each file.

STMicroelectronics HAL and CMSIS
--------------------------------
Everything under `target/Drivers/` is generated or supplied by
STMicroelectronics and is covered by the licence files distributed with
it, including `target/Drivers/CMSIS/Device/ST/STM32F4xx/LICENSE.txt`.
The CubeMX-generated sources under `target/Core/` and
`target/startup_stm32f411xe.s` carry ST's licence terms in their own
headers.
